    "status": "active",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "updated": "2026-09-20",
    "note": "Carrier for the separate package-owned signed Manus memory MCP stdio lane. A local draft may place only the Manus-scoped agent door and Manus signing key in the Custom MCP encrypted environment; the launcher derives the public Manus grant and removes per-process material on exit. Never add an HTTP URL, provider credential, human door, peer key, or raw assertion here."
  },
